WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:07.229
Speaker 1: Not shockingly, much of the controversy
around vaccine requirements is dramatically

00:00:07.229 --> 00:00:12.250
exaggerated by people looking to get attention,
people looking to fundraise, people looking

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:16.240
to fearmonger, people looking to play the
victim card.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:22.100
Most Americans support vaccine requirements
for workplaces, classrooms and sporting events,

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.760
period, but just a majority.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.570
When I say most, I mean a majority.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:30.060
Now, I don't say this because I think that
just because something is popular, it should

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.060
be the law.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:35.890
I don't there was a point where a lot of people
thought gay marriage shouldn't be legal, that

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:38.559
didn't mean that that's what it should be.

00:00:38.559 --> 00:00:40.180
You don't put everything to a vote.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:44.820
But I say this because there is not nearly
the controversy over vaccine requirements

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:48.059
that some want you to believe there is.

00:00:48.059 --> 00:00:55.909
So the numbers from a new CNN poll overall
for every day activities, only 51 percent

00:00:55.909 --> 00:00:59.780
favor versus 49 percent oppose vaccine requirements.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:04.030
That's a very, very small it's basically within
the margin of error, 50/50.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:09.750
But when you say what about vaccine requirements
for places of work, 54 percent are in favor.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.880
The other 46 percent are split between against
and being unsure.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:17.030
54 percent say vaccines should be required
for places of work.

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:21.880
Fifty five percent say vaccines should be
required for in-person classes.

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:26.710
Fifty five percent say vaccines should be
required for sporting events or concerts,

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:30.880
comparatively, only 41 percent say vaccines
should be required for the grocery store.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:31.880
That's predictable.

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:34.479
That that's that's not shocking to me.

00:01:34.479 --> 00:01:39.590
Also, every month that this poll is done,
support for these vaccine requirements goes

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:40.590
up.

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:44.570
And I anticipate that the numbers will be
even higher in terms of support for these

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.390
vaccine requirements in another month.

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:48.799
So this is not overwhelming support.

00:01:48.799 --> 00:01:53.439
It's not like after Sandy Hook with universal
background checks, 88, 90 percent of the country

00:01:53.439 --> 00:01:55.650
said we need universal background checks.

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:57.140
We still couldn't get it done, by the way.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:02.840
But it's a slight majority, whereas right
wing media would have you believe this is

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:06.399
tyranny over which the entire country is outraged.

00:02:06.399 --> 00:02:07.780
That's just not the case.

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:11.820
Part of the reason why support continues to
increase for these requirements is that the

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:15.599
virus is spreading and things are really,
really bad in much of the country.

00:02:15.599 --> 00:02:20.819
If everyone were vaccinated, it would effectively
reduce the total public health burden of covid

00:02:20.819 --> 00:02:23.730
down to about the level of the flu.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:24.810
We don't have that.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:29.180
The unvaccinated are burdening the health
care system to such a degree that there's

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:30.819
very little choice left.

00:02:30.819 --> 00:02:36.220
But for Joe Biden to try these ideas, this
sort of spreading anti vaccine tourism that

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:39.030
has infected so many is a virus of itself.

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:41.540
It's its own infection.

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:47.959
And let's be honest, when we say more than
half the country supports most of these requirements,

00:02:47.959 --> 00:02:54.390
it's mostly Democrats, a fair number of independents
and a very small number of Republicans.

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:57.360
Public health has become partizan.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:58.850
Science has become partizan.

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:02.840
You don't like the science to pretend that
science is just an opinion and come up with

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.430
a different one.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:06.750
That's a real tragedy that we're experiencing.

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:11.180
And unfortunately, although we are dealing
with it to a far greater degree than most

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:16.170
other countries, it's actually starting to
infect some other countries as well.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:19.690
And we're going to talk more about that a
little bit later on in the program.

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:27.239
Let me know if you favor vaccine requirements
for work concerts, grocery stores.

